pstack-codex is a Codex-native adaptation of selected workflows from pstack.

Upstream project: https://github.com/cursor/plugins/tree/main/pstack
Upstream version reviewed: 0.14.5
Upstream author: Lauren Tan
License: MIT

The adaptation replaces Cursor-specific agents, model routing, configuration,
automation, and shipping commands with Codex skills, plans, goals, collaboration
tools, approval boundaries, and repository-local instructions.
